.DS_Store

# Timestamped filenames and content (execution_trace_<timestamp>.tsv etc,
# see nextflow.config's trace_report_suffix) — excluded from structure too
# (see tests/default.nf.test's stable_path ignore).
pipeline_info/*

# OrthoFinder (orthogroups, gene trees, species tree, comparative stats) has
# documented run-to-run variance from tree-building/tie-breaking (the old,
# now-removed orthofinder.nf.test flagged this explicitly). The BLAST/DIAMOND
# search stage feeds it and can vary in result ordering under threading, so
# it inherits the same risk. Existence/structure still checked via stable_path.
orthofinder_blast/**
orthofinder_cafe/**

# CAFE5's Nelder-Mead optimizer (lambda, -lnL, model/k selection) and
# anything derived from it (plots, summaries) can differ slightly run to
# run even on identical input.
cafe/**
cafe_plot/**
